    "description": "<p>Kinetic energy pulls or pushes your target in a direction of your choosing.</p><p>Choose a creature within <strong>10 spaces </strong>of <strong>Size 1</strong> or smaller. They must make an opposed <strong>Resilience</strong> check or be pushed up to <strong>5 spaces</strong> in any direction.</p><p>Each extra success increases the push by <strong>+1 space</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you may increase the maximum <strong>Size</strong> of the target by <strong>+1</strong> per 2 extra successes.</p>",
